{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.1.1","notes":"The orb now looks at your screen itself when you ask about it (\"what am I looking at?\", \"what's wrong here?\"), even with the eye off, instead of handing it to an agent chat.","payload":"","signature":"pWdsv3UHsOTT6hGCZ+py+rxojJVvcezDpNI6Ta6aaz8JzQj15WdWxXSPcaki3If+GHZ41s8YCYzgUIa6lbVqBA=="}